OL,3,GNEWSAThe remote village helping        
OL,4,Apensioners stay stronger               
OL,6,FWith the nearest major hospital 30     
OL,7,Fmiles away and ambulance delays a      
OL,8,Freality for some residents, a village  
OL,9,Fon Exmoor is taking steps to help older
OL,10,Fpeople stay healthy, active and        
OL,11,Findependent.                           
OL,13,FThe Stronger for Longer campaign in    
OL,14,FPorlock encourages people to improve   
OL,15,Ftheir strength and balance to reduce   
OL,16,Fthe risk of falls and remain in their  
OL,17,Fown homes for longer.                  
OL,19,FSupporters say the initiative could    
OL,20,Fhelp residents stay independent in a   
OL,21,Fcommunity where access to emergency    
OL,22,Fcare can be difficult.                 
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
