OL,3,GNEWSAThe remote village helping        
OL,4,Apensioners stay stronger               
OL,6,F"We need to do everything that we can  
OL,7,Fto look after our own, within the      
OL,8,Fcommunity," said Deborah Stanyon, who  
OL,9,Fonce waited more than two hours for an 
OL,10,Fambulance after breaking her back.     
